# Allow-list: nothing enters the build context unless it is named below.
# This keeps `.env` (API token), `.git`, `target/`, `docs/` and local agent
# tooling (.claude/, .tirith/, .serena/) out of the image layers and makes
# the context a few hundred kB instead of gigabytes.
*

# What `cargo build --locked --bin indexer` needs:
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
# build.rs embeds migrations/*.sql into the binary.
!build.rs
!migrations/
!bin/
!src/

# ...minus what it does not need (later rules win).
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
